    Seat selection
    SubLayer:
    Ancillary services
    SubLayer:
    Payment processing

Layer:
Pricing
    SubLayer:
    Dynamic fare engine
    SubLayer:
    Revenue management sync
    SubLayer:
    Promotional fares
    SubLayer:
    Tax and fee calculation
    SubLayer:
    Price guarantee

Layer:
Check-in
    SubLayer:
    Online check-in
    SubLayer:
    Mobile boarding pass
    SubLayer:
    Baggage drop-off
    SubLayer:
    Seat change
    SubLayer:
    Upgrade offers

Layer:
Flight Management
    SubLayer:
    Schedule management
    SubLayer:
    Gate assignment
    SubLayer:
    Status updates
